    {
      "id": "flex_mode",
      "type": "select",
      "label": "Pika Flex adapter",
      "default": "auto",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "auto",
          "label": "auto — references if present, text-only otherwise"
        },
        {
          "value": "ref2va",
          "label": "ref2va — references → video (needs a picture or a clip)",
          "sets": [
            {
              "node": "1",
              "field": "unet_name",
              "value": "minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors"
            },
            {
              "node": "40",
              "field": "lora_name",
              "value": "pika_h3_flex_ref2va_v1_bf16.safetensors"
            },
            {
              "node": "enh_ref",
              "field": "value",
              "value": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "value": "fl2va",
          "label": "fl2va — text → video (plain text2v, empty bin)",
          "sets": [
            {
              "node": "1",
              "field": "unet_name",
              "value": "minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors"
            },
            {
              "node": "40",
              "field": "lora_name",
              "value": "pika_h3_flex_fl2va_v1_bf16.safetensors"
            },
            {
              "node": "enh_ref",
              "field": "value",
              "value": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "help": "auto follows the material bin: references use ref2va, an empty bin uses fl2va. Explicit ref2va still requires a picture or clip; explicit fl2va still requires an empty bin. The Pika Flex LoRA and H3 model move together; lcm and the 6-step sigma ladder stay locked."
    },
    {
      "id": "aspect",
